      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Script**\n\nI'm currently focused on the Python script's design. I've decided to use Google Cloud Secret Manager for secret retrieval. The core function will fetch and parse the JSON secret. I'm aiming for simplicity and efficiency in the `parse_json_secret.py` file.\n\n\n**Refining the Implementation**\n\nI've decided on the `parse_json_secret` function, which accepts project and secret IDs. It will retrieve the secret using the `google-cloud-secret-manager` library and then parse the JSON payload. I'm prioritizing error handling to make the script robust. I have finalized the core structure.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818722654,
          "start": 1789818721496
        },
